      "review_description": "I recently had an AlphaESS 20kWh battery system installed by SOLAI and the experience was excellent from start to finish. Mathieu and Anthony gave clear and honest advice from day 1 to help me choose the best option for my home, making sure it would work seamlessly with my SolarEdge system. The installation was on time, tidy, and very professional — everything was set up neatly and explained clearly. Since then, the system has run flawlessly and has delivered exactly as promised. It was a very good value proposition, I’m very happy with the service and wouldn’t hesitate to recommend SOLAI to anyone looking for a reliable solar and battery solution.",
