      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We recently had solar panels installed at our home, and the entire experience was outstanding. I met Mathieu and Anthony through my workplace, and they were incredibly helpful from the very beginning. They provided a clear and competitive quote, explained the entire solar process in detail, and patiently answered every question my husband and I had—no matter how many we asked!Mathieu, in particular, went above and beyond, always available to respond to our inquiries, even outside of regular hours. The installation was smooth, tidy, and professionally done—no mess left behind. They also helped set up the app, making it easy for us to monitor our system, and ongoing support has been readily available whenever needed.I truly appreciate all the help and support we received and would highly recommend this business to anyone considering solar. Thank you again, Mathieu and Anthony!",
