      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I recently had a solar system installed (roof panels and battery) by Solai and couldn't be happier with the entire experience. From start to finish, the process was smooth, transparent, and handled with the utmost professionalism.A big shoutout to Mathieu and Anthony, who were absolutely fantastic throughout the installation. They were punctual, knowledgeable, and went above and beyond to ensure everything was set up perfectly. They took the time to explain the system, answer all my questions, and made sure I was comfortable with how everything works before they left.The quality of workmanship was top-notch, and it's clear that Solai takes pride in their work. I highly recommend Solai to anyone considering solar—reliable service, great communication, and an excellent team. Thanks again for making the switch to solar such a great experience!",
