      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We recently had an 11.4kW solar system installed by Solai Energy Solutions and couldn't be happier with the entire experience. From the initial consultation to final installation, the team was knowledgeable, courteous, and truly professional.What stood out most was how well they listened to our needs. They tailored a system specifically for our household rather than pushing a one-size-fits-all package. Their attention to detail and meticulous approach gave us confidence at every step.Since the system went live, we've seen a dramatic drop in our power bills — a clear sign that the system is working exactly as promised. We're so impressed that we've already decided to go back to Solai for battery storage to complement the system and make the most of the new government rebate.If you're looking for a solar installer who knows their stuff and genuinely cares about delivering the best outcome for your home, we couldn't recommend Solai Energy Solutions highly enough.",
